text": "so and then it's one hundred percent"}, {"start_seconds": 649.12, "end_seconds": 653.76, "text": "correct"}, {"start_seconds": 651.2, "end_seconds": 654.96, "text": "and then uh so krivna here got really"}, {"start_seconds": 653.76, "end_seconds": 657.2, "text": "lucky"}, {"start_seconds": 654.96, "end_seconds": 658.32, "text": "and we say okay like we see we look at"}, {"start_seconds": 657.2, "end_seconds": 659.36, "text": "the numbers"}, {"start_seconds": 658.32, "end_seconds": 662.88, "text": "so"}, {"start_seconds": 659.36, "end_seconds": 665.68, "text": "like the dollars are quite good um like"}, {"start_seconds": 662.88, "end_seconds": 668.08, "text": "euros slow test and troubles are very"}, {"start_seconds": 665.68, "end_seconds": 669.6, "text": "bad at predicting"}, {"start_seconds": 668.08, "end_seconds": 672.24, "text": "uh spam"}, {"start_seconds": 669.6, "end_seconds": 674.56, "text": "krivna is the best one it has"}, {"start_seconds": 672.24, "end_seconds": 676.72, "text": "100 accuracy"}, {"start_seconds": 674.56, "end_seconds": 679.6, "text": "for predicting our sum messages but we"}, {"start_seconds": 676.72, "end_seconds": 681.2, "text": "all know that this is"}, {"start_seconds": 679.6, "end_seconds": 683.92, "text": "this is really random right so we cannot"}, {"start_seconds": 681.2, "end_seconds": 686.84, "text": "really control the sequence"}, {"start_seconds": 683.92, "end_seconds": 690.0, "text": "this uh this coin just got particularly"}, {"start_seconds": 686.84, "end_seconds": 692.24, "text": "lucky and it managed to produce the same"}, {"start_seconds": 690.0, "end_seconds": 694.0, "text": "sequence as we had in the validation"}, {"start_seconds": 692.24, "end_seconds": 696.08, "text": "data set"}, {"start_seconds": 694.0, "end_seconds": 698.88, "text": "and while this is a two example the"}, {"start_seconds": 696.08, "end_seconds": 701.12, "text": "exact same thing can happen with a real"}, {"start_seconds": 698.88, "end_seconds": 702.48, "text": "model so a model can just get lucky so"}, {"start_seconds": 701.12, "end_seconds": 705.36, "text": "maybe let's say"}, {"start_seconds": 702.48, "end_seconds": 707.6, "text": "this is a neural net"}, {"start_seconds": 705.36, "end_seconds": 709.52, "text": "and this is i don't know uh decision"}, {"start_seconds": 707.6, "end_seconds": 711.36, "text": "tree this is logistic regression i don't"}, {"start_seconds": 709.52, "end_seconds": 714.08, "text": "know this is random forest and this is"}, {"start_seconds": 711.36, "end_seconds": 717.2, "text": "uh i know gradient boosting"}, {"start_seconds": 714.08, "end_seconds": 719.76, "text": "different kind of models and neural net"}, {"start_seconds": 717.2, "end_seconds": 722.0, "text": "just got lucky at predicting"}, {"start_seconds": 719.76, "end_seconds": 726.16, "text": "this particular"}, {"start_seconds": 722.0, "end_seconds": 728.56, "text": "part of the data set so this particular"}, {"start_seconds": 726.16, "end_seconds": 731.2, "text": "subset of our data"}, {"start_seconds": 728.56, "end_seconds": 733.6, "text": "it just happen to"}, {"start_seconds": 731.2, "end_seconds": 735.28, "text": "to do really well on this just by pure"}, {"start_seconds": 733.6, "end_seconds": 738.16, "text": "chance right"}, {"start_seconds": 735.28, "end_seconds": 740.64, "text": "and if we take another part if we take"}, {"start_seconds": 738.16, "end_seconds": 742.8, "text": "another 20"}, {"start_seconds": 740.64, "end_seconds": 744.72, "text": "and apply the same model then the"}, {"start_seconds": 742.8, "end_seconds": 747.36, "text": "results would be totally different so if"}, {"start_seconds": 744.72, "end_seconds": 749.04, "text": "we take ukrainian grievna and apply to a"}, {"start_seconds": 747.36, "end_seconds": 750.96, "text": "different 20"}, {"start_seconds": 749.04, "end_seconds": 752.96, "text": "probably it's very unlikely that we"}, {"start_seconds": 750.96, "end_seconds": 756.64, "text": "again will manage to"}, {"start_seconds": 752.96, "end_seconds": 758.24, "text": "predict it with 100 accuracy"}, {"start_seconds": 756.64, "end_seconds": 759.92, "text": "so this"}, {"start_seconds": 758.24, "end_seconds": 763.04, "text": "in statistics this is called multiple"}, {"start_seconds": 759.92, "end_seconds": 765.36, "text": "comparison problems when we perform the"}, {"start_seconds": 763.04, "end_seconds": 768.08, "text": "same comparison many many times so when"}, {"start_seconds": 765.36, "end_seconds": 769.68, "text": "we use many many different models"}, {"start_seconds": 768.08, "end_seconds": 771.52, "text": "and evaluate them against the same"}, {"start_seconds": 769.68, "end_seconds": 773.92, "text": "validation data set"}, {"start_seconds": 771.52, "end_seconds": 776.64, "text": "one of the models can get"}, {"start_seconds": 773.92, "end_seconds": 779.2, "text": "particularly lucky for no reason just by"}, {"start_seconds": 776.64, "end_seconds": 781.2, "text": "chance it gets lucky and it produces a"}, {"start_seconds": 779.2, "end_seconds": 782.64, "text": "good result"}, {"start_seconds": 781.2, "end_seconds": 785.84, "text": "this can happen with machine learning a"}, {"start_seconds": 782.64, "end_seconds": 788.4, "text": "lot right so because at the end these"}, {"start_seconds": 785.84, "end_seconds": 790.8, "text": "methods are probabilistic so a thing"}, {"start_seconds": 788.4, "end_seconds": 792.72, "text": "like this can happen that a model just"}, {"start_seconds": 790.8, "end_seconds": 795.68, "text": "gets lucky"}, {"start_seconds": 792.72, "end_seconds": 797.68, "text": "to guard against cases like this what we"}, {"start_seconds": 795.68, "end_seconds": 800.4, "text": "do instead of"}, {"start_seconds": 797.68, "end_seconds": 802.72, "text": "holding out just one data set we"}, {"start_seconds": 800.4, "end_seconds": 804.96, "text": "actually hold out two data sets so let's"}, {"start_seconds": 802.72, "end_seconds": 806.56, "text": "say this is our data set"}, {"start_seconds": 804.96, "end_seconds": 809.12, "text": "so we"}, {"start_seconds": 806.56, "end_seconds": 812.56, "text": "take 20 of this data"}, {"start_seconds": 809.12, "end_seconds": 814.48, "text": "for validation purposes"}, {"start_seconds": 812.56, "end_seconds": 815.36, "text": "we take twenty percent"}, {"start_seconds": 814.48, "end_seconds": 816.08, "text": "more"}, {"start_seconds": 815.36, "end_seconds": 819.12, "text": "for"}, {"start_seconds": 816.08, "end_seconds": 821.68, "text": "testing purposes"}, {"start_seconds": 819.12, "end_seconds": 823.92, "text": "and we take the remaining sixty percent"}, {"start_seconds": 821.68, "end_seconds": 825.92, "text": "and by the way this sixty twenty twenty"}, {"start_seconds": 823.92, "end_seconds": 827.2, "text": "this is not set at stone it can be any"}, {"start_seconds": 825.92, "end_seconds": 830.16, "text": "value"}, {"start_seconds": 827.2, "end_seconds": 832.56, "text": "and the remaining 60 we take for"}, {"start_seconds": 830.16, "end_seconds": 834.32, "text": "training"}, {"start_seconds": 832.56, "end_seconds": 837.36, "text": "right so"}, {"start_seconds": 834.32, "end_seconds": 840.8, "text": "what we have is we have three"}, {"start_seconds": 837.36, "end_seconds": 842.88, "text": "not overlapping subsets of our data"}, {"start_seconds": 840.8, "end_seconds": 843.84, "text": "training data validation data and test"}, {"start_seconds": 842.88, "end_seconds": 845.76, "text": "data"}, {"start_seconds": 843.84, "end_seconds": 846.72, "text": "and what we do next"}, {"start_seconds": 845.76, "end_seconds": 848.32, "text": "is"}, {"start_seconds": 846.72, "end_seconds": 850.48, "text": "we"}, {"start_seconds": 848.32, "end_seconds": 851.36, "text": "hide this data set so we just put it"}, {"start_seconds": 850.48, "end_seconds": 853.52, "text": "away"}, {"start_seconds": 851.36, "end_seconds": 855.84, "text": "we forget about this"}, {"start_seconds": 853.52, "end_seconds": 858.32, "text": "and we do the model selection in the"}, {"start_seconds": 855.84, "end_seconds": 859.52, "text": "same way as i described previously so we"}, {"start_seconds": 858.32, "end_seconds": 862.4, "text": "take our"}, {"start_seconds": 859.52, "end_seconds": 864.32, "text": "x we take our y we train our model g"}, {"start_seconds": 862.4, "end_seconds": 868.08, "text": "then we take our x validation y"}, {"start_seconds": 864.32, "end_seconds": 871.92, "text": "validation we apply g and we"}, {"start_seconds": 868.08, "end_seconds": 871.92, "text": "calculate all this accuracy and so on"}, {"start_seconds": 872.0, "end_seconds": 876.72, "text": "and here at this step we select the best"}, {"start_seconds": 874.24, "end_seconds": 879.28, "text": "model right so"}, {"start_seconds": 876.72, "end_seconds": 881.28, "text": "it could be let's say neural network"}, {"start_seconds": 879.28, "end_seconds": 882.88, "text": "so we did all this exercise of selecting"}, {"start_seconds": 881.28, "end_seconds": 886.0, "text": "the best model"}, {"start_seconds": 882.88, "end_seconds": 887.92, "text": "and then next to make sure that this"}, {"start_seconds": 886.0, "end_seconds": 890.0, "text": "model didn't get"}, {"start_seconds": 887.92, "end_seconds": 892.24, "text": "particularly lucky on this validation"}, {"start_seconds": 890.0, "end_seconds": 895.28, "text": "set what we do next"}, {"start_seconds": 892.24, "end_seconds": 897.6, "text": "is we apply this neural network to the"}, {"start_seconds": 895.28, "end_seconds": 900.0, "text": "test data set so we take the test data"}, {"start_seconds": 897.6, "end_seconds": 902.64, "text": "set we again extract the"}, {"start_seconds": 900.0, "end_seconds": 904.32, "text": "our feature matrix or target variable"}, {"start_seconds": 902.64, "end_seconds": 906.72, "text": "from the test data set"}, {"start_seconds": 904.32, "end_seconds": 908.8, "text": "and we again do an extra round of"}, {"start_seconds": 906.72, "end_seconds": 912.48, "text": "validation on the test data set"}, {"start_seconds": 908.8, "end_seconds": 913.76, "text": "we just want to make sure that um"}, {"start_seconds": 912.48, "end_seconds": 916.4, "text": "our model"}, {"start_seconds": 913.76, "end_seconds": 918.08, "text": "the model we think is best is actually"}, {"start_seconds": 916.4, "end_seconds": 920.24, "text": "the best one"}, {"start_seconds": 918.08, "end_seconds": 921.44, "text": "and this is how it works okay so let's"}, {"start_seconds": 920.24, "end_seconds": 923.84, "text": "say"}, {"start_seconds": 921.44, "end_seconds": 926.08, "text": "for our example so we had"}, {"start_seconds": 923.84, "end_seconds": 928.56, "text": "logistic regression we have a decision"}, {"start_seconds": 926.08, "end_seconds": 930.48, "text": "tree we have random forest and we have a"}, {"start_seconds": 928.56, "end_seconds": 931.44, "text": "neural net"}, {"start_seconds": 930.48, "end_seconds": 933.6, "text": "so"}, {"start_seconds": 931.44, "end_seconds": 936.24, "text": "i think this one was 60"}, {"start_seconds": 933.6, "end_seconds": 939.2, "text": "six percent correct this may be 60 i"}, {"start_seconds": 936.24, "end_seconds": 941.36, "text": "don't remember i think this was 67"}, {"start_seconds": 939.2, "end_seconds": 943.12, "text": "and this was 80."}, {"start_seconds": 941.36, "end_seconds": 945.28, "text": "so if we see okay"}, {"start_seconds": 943.12, "end_seconds": 946.64, "text": "this neural network is the best one"}, {"start_seconds": 945.28, "end_seconds": 948.88, "text": "right"}, {"start_seconds": 946.64, "end_seconds": 952.4, "text": "so what we do next is we take the neural"}, {"start_seconds": 948.88, "end_seconds": 956.32, "text": "network only we forget about this"}, {"start_seconds": 952.4, "end_seconds": 958.24, "text": "and we take our test data set"}, {"start_seconds": 956.32, "end_seconds": 960.64, "text": "and now we apply the neural network to"}, {"start_seconds": 958.24, "end_seconds": 963.36, "text": "the test data set and get a number and"}, {"start_seconds": 960.64, "end_seconds": 965.92, "text": "we see let's say the number is it says"}, {"start_seconds": 963.36, "end_seconds": 969.6, "text": "the accuracy is 79 percent i don't see"}, {"start_seconds": 965.92, "end_seconds": 970.48, "text": "okay we have percent here we have 78"}, {"start_seconds": 969.6, "end_seconds": 972.48, "text": "here"}, {"start_seconds": 970.48, "end_seconds": 975.6, "text": "it's very close it's reasonably close"}, {"start_seconds": 972.48, "end_seconds": 978.32, "text": "and we conclude that this model"}, {"start_seconds": 975.6, "end_seconds": 979.52, "text": "behaves quite well so this process is"}, {"start_seconds": 978.32, "end_seconds": 981.44, "text": "called the"}, {"start_seconds": 979.52, "end_seconds": 983.92, "text": "model selection process"}, {"start_seconds": 981.44, "end_seconds": 985.84, "text": "and this is one of the most important"}, {"start_seconds": 983.92, "end_seconds": 986.8, "text": "things in machine learning to be able to"}, {"start_seconds": 985.84, "end_seconds": 988.88, "text": "actually"}, {"start_seconds": 986.8, "end_seconds": 991.04, "text": "set this up and"}, {"start_seconds": 988.88, "end_seconds": 993.04, "text": "this is quite simple like as you see all"}, {"start_seconds": 991.04, "end_seconds": 995.28, "text": "we need to do is we need to split our"}, {"start_seconds": 993.04, "end_seconds": 996.96, "text": "data set into three parts"}, {"start_seconds": 995.28, "end_seconds": 998.56, "text": "so let me just"}, {"start_seconds": 996.96, "end_seconds": 1001.12, "text": "so first one"}, {"start_seconds": 998.56, "end_seconds": 1003.6, "text": "is split the data set"}, {"start_seconds": 1001.12, "end_seconds": 1004.88, "text": "split the data set so this is our first"}, {"start_seconds": 1003.6, "end_seconds": 1007.12, "text": "step"}, {"start_seconds": 1004.88, "end_seconds": 1007.12, "text": "right"}, {"start_seconds": 1007.76, "end_seconds": 1013.2, "text": "then what you do next is you"}, {"start_seconds": 1010.48, "end_seconds": 1013.2, "text": "train a model"}, {"start_seconds": 1013.44, "end_seconds": 1017.76, "text": "then you"}, {"start_seconds": 1015.92, "end_seconds": 1020.0, "text": "validate the model using the validation"}, {"start_seconds": 1017.76, "end_seconds": 1022.4, "text": "data set if you remember we have three"}, {"start_seconds": 1020.0, "end_seconds": 1024.08, "text": "data sets so the first one is"}, {"start_seconds": 1022.4, "end_seconds": 1026.24, "text": "train"}, {"start_seconds": 1024.08, "end_seconds": 1028.48, "text": "then we have validation and we have test"}, {"start_seconds": 1026.24, "end_seconds": 1031.04, "text": "data set"}, {"start_seconds": 1028.48, "end_seconds": 1033.52, "text": "so we split it into three parts we train"}, {"start_seconds": 1031.04, "end_seconds": 1035.44, "text": "our model training data set"}, {"start_seconds": 1033.52, "end_seconds": 1037.68, "text": "we apply the model to the validation"}, {"start_seconds": 1035.44, "end_seconds": 1040.32, "text": "data set"}, {"start_seconds": 1037.68, "end_seconds": 1042.24, "text": "and we see we record"}, {"start_seconds": 1040.32, "end_seconds": 1045.28, "text": "what is the"}, {"start_seconds": 1042.24, "end_seconds": 1048.72, "text": "accuracy or how good it is and we see"}, {"start_seconds": 1045.28, "end_seconds": 1050.08, "text": "that for logistic regression it's 66"}, {"start_seconds": 1048.72, "end_seconds": 1052.8, "text": "right"}, {"start_seconds": 1050.08, "end_seconds": 1055.12, "text": "and we repeat this uh two steps"}, {"start_seconds": 1052.8, "end_seconds": 1058.48, "text": "uh three and four two and"}, {"start_seconds": 1055.12, "end_seconds": 1061.2, "text": "three how many times we need so we can"}, {"start_seconds": 1058.48, "end_seconds": 1062.72, "text": "repeat it for many many different models"}, {"start_seconds": 1061.2, "end_seconds": 1065.36, "text": "and then we will have"}, {"start_seconds": 1062.72, "end_seconds": 1067.12, "text": "this table like on the previous slide"}, {"start_seconds": 1065.36, "end_seconds": 1068.56, "text": "for different models"}, {"start_seconds": 1067.12, "end_seconds": 1069.84, "text": "different"}, {"start_seconds": 1068.56, "end_seconds": 1072.56, "text": "values right"}, {"start_seconds": 1069.84, "end_seconds": 1073.44, "text": "so and then what happens next we did"}, {"start_seconds": 1072.56, "end_seconds": 1075.68, "text": "this"}, {"start_seconds": 1073.44, "end_seconds": 1080.6, "text": "for many different models"}, {"start_seconds": 1075.68, "end_seconds": 1080.6, "text": "and we select the best one"}, {"start_seconds": 1081.76, "end_seconds": 1084.72, "text": "the"}, {"start_seconds": 1083.04, "end_seconds": 1086.48, "text": "best"}, {"start_seconds": 1084.72, "end_seconds": 1089.2, "text": "so we have that"}, {"start_seconds": 1086.48, "end_seconds": 1091.36, "text": "and then we"}, {"start_seconds": 1089.2, "end_seconds": 1093.44, "text": "using the best value the best model we"}, {"start_seconds": 1091.36, "end_seconds": 1094.56, "text": "have from the previous step"}, {"start_seconds": 1093.44, "end_seconds": 1097.2, "text": "we"}, {"start_seconds": 1094.56, "end_seconds": 1100.0, "text": "applied to the"}, {"start_seconds": 1097.2, "end_seconds": 1103.84, "text": "test data and this is our"}, {"start_seconds": 1100.0, "end_seconds": 1103.84, "text": "like we check if everything is good"}, {"start_seconds": 1104.72, "end_seconds": 1108.48, "text": "and this is the model selection process"}, {"start_seconds": 1106.8, "end_seconds": 1110.0, "text": "right so it's a"}, {"start_seconds": 1108.48, "end_seconds": 1111.52, "text": "six step process"}, {"start_seconds": 1110.0, "end_seconds": 1113.76, "text": "uh"}, {"start_seconds": 1111.52, "end_seconds": 1115.68, "text": "split the data into three"}, {"start_seconds": 1113.76, "end_seconds": 1116.96, "